    "Vectorised NumPy often closes most of the speed gap because the heavy work already runs in C.",
    "Combine them: prototype and test in Python, then port time-critical kernels to C and call them via C extensions, ctypes/cffi or Cython; or run C firmware with Python for analysis.",
